@startuml
title CON-SD-D03 Dependency Degradation Detection and Degraded-Watch Flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Dependency signal received\nvendor / connector / projection / payment / POS / gate;
:Connector or platform reports facts and health context;
:Central PMS / approved policy classifies impact;
if (Normal authority prerequisites still safe?) then (yes)
  :Remain normal with visibility;
else (degraded signal)
  :Enter degraded-watch visibility;
  :Operator Console and Dashboard show warnings;
  if (Activation approved?) then (yes)
    :Route to continuity activation;
  else (no)
    :Block unsafe workflows / fail closed;
  endif
endif
stop

note right
Degraded-watch is observation and restriction posture.
It does not permit degraded payment, fiscal bypass, manual release, or exit.
end note
@enduml
